---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="hero">
  <div
    class="hero-bg"
    style={`background-image: url(${base}images/hero.jpg);`}
  >
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <h2 class="hero-quote">Putting the last first.</h2>
      <p class="hero-quote-author">— Robert Chambers</p>
      <p class="hero-intro-line">
        We strive to bring poor and vulnerable communities to the centre of
        development — as active participants shaping, managing and owning their
        own future.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="cta cta-primary" href={`${base}work/`}>Our Work</a>
        <a class="cta cta-outline" href={`${base}contact/`}>Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hero-intro">
  <div class="hero-intro-inner reveal">
    <p class="hero-statement">
      <strong>People in Centre Consulting (PiC)</strong> is committed to
      bringing poor and vulnerable communities to the centre of development
      processes. We work to create conditions in which people are not passive
      recipients of assistance but active participants in shaping, managing,
      and owning their development. Through research, planning, implementation
      support, capacity building, and knowledge generation, we help governments,
      international agencies, and civil society organisations build programmes
      that create space for people's own agency, strengthen institutional capacities 
      for community-centred processes, promote socially just solutions, and
      achieve lasting change.
    </p>

    <p class="pillars-lead">PiC's approach rests on three fundamental shifts.</p>

    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <h3 class="pillar-title">From Infrastructure to People</h3>
        <p>
          Putting communities at the centre of every intervention, not just
          buildings and systems.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h3 class="pillar-title">From Projects to Processes</h3>
        <p>
          Supporting the long-term processes, capacities and institutions that
          make change last.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h3 class="pillar-title">From Delivery to Participation</h3>
        <p>
          Enabling people to shape, manage and own their development, rather
          than merely receive it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100vw;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    background: var(--color-dark);
    padding: 0;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 74vh;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(4, 4, 21, 0.5) 0%,
      rgba(4, 4, 21, 0.28) 50%,
      rgba(4, 4, 21, 0.66) 100%
    );
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .hero-quote {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    font-family: "Roboto Slab", serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.3rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .hero-quote-author {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .hero-intro-line {
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease,
      background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-primary {
    background: var(--color-cyan);
    color: #040415;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(52, 181, 245, 0.4);
  }

  .cta-primary:hover {
    background: #5ec2f7;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(52, 181, 245, 0.5);
  }

  .cta-outline {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .cta-outline:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-color: #fff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero-ctas .cta {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 280px;
    }
  }

  .hero-intro {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100vw;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-heading);
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-intro-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .hero-statement {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin-top: 0;
    font-family: "Roboto Slab", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .hero-statement strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .pillars-lead {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    font-family: "Roboto Slab", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .pillar + .pillar {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-heading);
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .pillar {
    padding-right: 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-family: "Roboto Slab", serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .pillar p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero-bg {
      min-height: 63vh;
    }

    .hero-content {
      padding: 2.25rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .hero-intro-inner {
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
    }

    .pillars {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .pillar + .pillar {
      border-left: 0;
      padding-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    .pillar {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
